{# A CONTRIBUTED SECTION ON A STATION'S RECORD, drawn as one banded card.

   THE AREA DRAWS THE BAND AND THE MODULE FILLS IT. The card, the heading
   row, the contributor tag and the summary line are written HERE, once, so
   that a roster band and a permits band cannot come out looking like two
   different products — and so that no module has to restate a selector this
   sheet already owns.

   THE TAG SURVIVES A SCREENSHOT. When the module is parked the band is
   simply gone, and a person has to be able to read that as the system
   working rather than as a page that broke.

   THE ANCHOR IS THE SECTION'S OWN ID, so a module can link somebody straight
   to its part of a page it does not own. #}
<div class="c rband" id="{{ band.section.id }}">
    <div class="rb-hd">
        <span class="tab"><span class="ao-by {{ band.moduleSlug }}"><i></i>{{ band.moduleSlug }}</span>{{ band.section.label }}</span>
        {% if band.section.summary %}<span class="rb-ttl">{{ band.section.summary }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if band.section.actions is not empty %}
            <span class="rb-act">
                {% for action in band.section.actions %}<a class="btn sm" href="{{ action.url }}">{{ action.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
            </span>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="rb-body">{{ include(band.section.template, band.section.variables, with_context = false) }}</div>
</div>
